# Small checked matrices for M22 code near-offenders

After fixing an inner involution, eight colors distinguish every elementary
actor whose code displacement is less than six. Equal colors on commuting
vertices give six independent cocode commutators. The code action is its
literal dual, including the full pair stabilizer and original pair line.

Source: Aschbacher--Smith H.16.5, printed p.404, refs/quasithin.pdf.
-/
